The sufficiency proof constructs the reduced map and checks independence of the representative. The counterexample distinguishes initial-snapshot rank from a trajectory-invariant subspace and tests a second time step, where a one-step fit is insufficient.
\paragraph{Audit corrections.} Low rank of finitely many observed states is not treated as an invariance certificate. Memory is counted as part of the state when it is used.
